00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.900
Whenever hair is put under stress.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:04.480
Cultures that use tight braids, twists, or buns

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.220
In Africa and Asia, have this happen to all the time.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:07.700
But it's also common in the US.

